  "word_count": 757,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n## For Oral Health Month, Consider Improving Your Health With Dental Implants!\n\n\nMarch 25, 2022\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nShare on facebook\n\nShare on linkedin\n\nShare on twitter\n\nShare on email\n\nDealing with missing or damaged teeth can surely be disappointing and even affect tooth function and quality of life. This issue can also negatively impact your smile, and even self-confidence, which is certainly no fun.\n\nFortunately, a dentist can assist you in solving this issue and get a new smile on that lovely face in no time! Treatment advances in dental implants in Los Angeles, CA may be the best option to remedy any of your dental issues, and a dentist may recommend them as a part of your treatment regimen.\n\n\n## Dental Implant Advantages\n\n\nNot only do dental implants provide a stunning new look and smile, but they can also restore tooth health and function. There are also several additional benefits and advantages associated with dental implants that should be considered, such as:\n\nImproved appearance – look and feel like the natural teeth.\n\nImproved speech – talk without worrying about if the implant will slip or not.\n\nComfortable – the implant fuses with your jawbone which takes away the discomfort of removeable dentures.\n\nEasier eating – eat food with confidence and no pain.\n\nConfidence booster – helps you feel better about yourself by giving you back your smile.\n\nImprovement of overall oral health – existing teeth are not altered to support your new implants.\n\nDurable – implants can last a lifetime with the right type of care and they are exceptionally durable. It is suggested to see your dentist for routine check ups.\n\nConvenient – removes embarrassing inconvenience of removing dentures and the need for adhesive.\n\nDental implants are surely a great option for tooth restoration, improved health, and increased self-confidence and quality of life. However, you should select a dentist in Los Angeles, CA that has the experience, knowledge, and advanced technology to place dental implants effectively and securely to ensure the best results for you.\n\n\n## Get a new, beautiful smile now!\n\n\nAre you ready to start showing off your bright, gorgeous smile again? Are you tired of not being able to smile because you have missing teeth, or your teeth are decaying?\n\nOur doctor, Dr. Tony Barriere, in our office by Los Angeles, CA is willing and ready to give you all the information you need to start your dental implant journey and schedule your consultation today!\n\nPrevPreviousDo Robots Really Do Dental Implant Procedures?\n\nNextWhy Should I Consider A Dental Implant To Replace My Missing Tooth?Next\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Are There Factors That Determine Which Type Of Dental Implant Procedure I Can Get Treated With?\n\n\nDental implants in Los Angeles, FL, are a safe and effective way to replace missing or damaged teeth. They are\n\nRead More »\n\nAugust 20, 2023\n\n\n### Does Anything Happen To My Jawbone If I Don’t Immediately Replace My Missing Teeth With Dental Implants?\n\n\nDental implants in Los Angeles, FL, are a gold standard tooth replacement option that are surgically placed in a patient’s\n\nAugust 14, 2023\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nCall Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
